Z||000000||DXR_DAD||12-03-2000||05:10 PM||||After looking at the side scoop post in the mall, and knowing that Steve is working on some type of "RAM AIR" system. I took a look at my Jeg's cat. The imports & Mustangs seem to have more than their share of "performance" intake systems, filters, tubes, piping, boxes, heatshelds, on and on??<BR>Question: If you remove the stock airbox is it smog legal? And what about the price!!!<BR>The Fiero Store $300.00. Who has a Fiero system for less??<P>Who is running a system like this???<BR>please post pics and info.<P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||1
